   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 267,
   "jp": "「ご主人様宛てに通信が入っております。@　グランヴェールにお戻り下さい」",
   "en": "Master, there is a transmission for you.@Please return to the Granveil.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
