   "jp": "「彼を知りて己を知れば、百戦して危うからず……@　敵の情報を得ぬまま戦いに出るという@　軽率な行動を戒めただけだ」",
   "en": "Know the enemy, know yourself, and you'll never@fall in a hundred battles. I was only cautioning@against rushing in without intel on the enemy.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
