   "jp": "「わかった、わかったよ！@　お説教なら、後でたっぷり聞いてやるから！」",
   "en": "Okay, okay, I get it!@I'll listen to all the lecturing you want later!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 292,
   "jp": "「……雇い主は逃げたか。@　ならば、この勝負、預けておくぞ」",
   "en": "...My employer has fled.@Then we'll settle this another time.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 293,
   "jp": "「……よし、追っ手は片付いたか。@　礼を言うぜ、キョウスケ、リューネ」",
   "en": "...Good, looks like we're rid of the pursuers.@Thanks, Kyosuke, Lüne.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 294,
   "jp": "「タイミングが良かったよ。@　でも、何であいつらに追われてたの？」",
   "en": "Lucky we showed up when we did.@But why were they chasing you?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 295,
   "jp": "「こっちも聞きてえことが色々ある。@　情報交換といこうぜ」",
   "en": "We've got plenty of questions of our own.@Let's trade info.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 296,
   "jp": "「わかったよ」",
   "en": "Sure.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 297,
   "jp": "「……演習中に召喚されたのなら、@　ヒリュウ改やハガネもこっちへ来てると@　思った方がいいね……」",
   "en": "...If you were summoned during an exercise,@we'd better assume the Hiryu Custom and Hagane@came over here too...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 298,
   "jp": "「俺やカチーナ中尉とラッセルは@　同じ所へ出て来たんだが、レオナや他のみんなは@　別の所へ跳ばされたみてえでな……」",
   "en": "Lieutenant Katina, Russel, and I ended up in the@same spot, but Leona and the others seem to've@been sent somewhere else...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 299,
   "jp": "「で、仲間を捜してる途中で@　あのスットコドッコイ軍に出会ったわけよ」",
   "en": "So while we were looking for our friends,@we ran into the Shtinkydonias army.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 300,
   "jp": "「シュテドニアス軍ですよ、中尉」",
   "en": "It's the Schtedonias army, Lieutenant.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 301,
   "jp": "「おう、それそれ。@　奴らはあたしらを保護するとか言い出して、@　協力を要請して来たんだが……」",
   "en": "Yeah, that's the one.@They said they'd take us under their wing,@and asked for our cooperation, but...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 302,
   "jp": "「連中の中にあの武者ガーリオンがいてな。@　それで胡散臭いと思って断ったら、@　いきなり襲い掛かって来やがった」",
   "en": "That samurai Guarlion was with 'em.@Smelled fishy, so we turned 'em down,@and they jumped us out of nowhere.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 303,
   "jp": "「味方にならねば、敵に回る……@　早い内に片づけておこうと考えたか」",
   "en": "If you won't join them, you're against them...@So they decided to deal with you early on.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 304,
   "jp": "「何にせよ、おめえらと会えて良かったぜ。@　キョウスケも無事だってわかったしな」",
   "en": "Anyway, it's damn good runnin' into you guys.@And now we know Kyosuke's okay, too.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 305,
   "jp": "「エクセ姐さん達、かなり心配してたッスよ」",
   "en": "Excellen and the others were real worried, man.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 306,
   "jp": "「……そうだろうな」",
   "en": "...I'd imagine so.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 307,
   "jp": "「あの……自分達はまだラ・ギアスのことを@　よくわかっていないんです。よろしければ、@　詳しく説明してもらえませんか」",
   "en": "Um... We still don't really understand@much about La Gias. If it's all right,@could you explain it to us in detail?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
