   "en": "Does that suit you, Gennacy?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 310,
   "jp": "「い、いたのか、あんた。@　……影薄いな」",
   "en": "Wh-whoa, you were here?@...You sure don't stand out, huh.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 311,
   "jp": "「………」",
   "en": "...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
